        read collect's compressed datafile?  (like 'collect -p
        <file>' plays back the data on UNIX)
        a. Bad Idea
        b. No Thanks
        c. No Opinion (I don't use collect -p feature now)
        d. Yes, I might use that.
        e. Definitely
A4:



Q5:     How often do you use cfilt? - including using it
