It works *better* (performance-wise) with TCPIP, from both the client and the
server's point of view. 

We routinely configure our M$box clients to default to TCPIP, and only use
Netbios as a fall-back last resort. "Control Panel", Networking, make sure that
TCPIP is listed as one of the protocols, and in property, check-box it as 
default protocol. 

